Marry me.

18
00:03:26,745 --> 00:03:27,745
Shang Zhitao.

19
00:04:24,945 --> 00:04:28,305
Your eyebrows. Why do you always frown?

20
00:04:29,025 --> 00:04:30,185
Are you tired?

21
00:04:38,465 --> 00:04:39,505
Come home with me.

22
00:04:57,145 --> 00:04:58,225
What's going on?

23
00:05:00,025 --> 00:05:00,865
Come on. Give it to me.

24
00:05:04,705 --> 00:05:06,145
Nothing. It's…

25
00:05:06,825 --> 00:05:08,305
I sprained my ankle.

26
00:05:08,905 --> 00:05:09,785
Is it serious?

27
00:05:09,865 --> 00:05:11,025
-Do you need to go to the hospital?
-It's not.

28
00:05:11,105 --> 00:05:12,185
It's fine. No need to go to the hospital.

29
00:05:15,825 --> 00:05:16,745
What happened?

30
00:05:18,305 --> 00:05:19,825
Today

31
00:05:21,305 --> 00:05:23,665
isn't my day.

32
00:05:28,385 --> 00:05:29,505
The event was ruined.

33
00:05:30,665 --> 00:05:34,145
One of our customers
already has a boyfriend,

34
00:05:34,225 --> 00:05:36,465
but she still joined our event.

35
00:05:37,225 --> 00:05:38,225
In the end,

36
00:05:38,745 --> 00:05:43,265
her boyfriend came to the venue
and made a mess out of it.

37
00:05:43,785 --> 00:05:46,985
I wanted to say something to comfort her,

38
00:05:47,065 --> 00:05:51,625
but she pushed me down on the ground.

39
00:05:52,225 --> 00:05:55,985
I sprained my ankle, and it hurts.

40
00:06:08,185 --> 00:06:09,425
Don't catch a cold.

41
00:06:10,465 --> 00:06:11,505
Go back first.

42
00:06:17,225 --> 00:06:18,065
Let's go.

43
00:06:21,465 --> 00:06:23,905
-Did I get it dirty?
-It's fine. Slow down.

44
00:06:29,745 --> 00:06:31,185
Give me a hand.

45
00:06:33,465 --> 00:06:34,305
Come.

46
00:06:50,185 --> 00:06:51,265
Come inside.

47
00:06:54,705 --> 00:06:55,545
Fish.

48
00:06:57,945 --> 00:06:58,905
Come here.

49
00:07:39,065 --> 00:07:39,905
Hello?

50
00:07:40,585 --> 00:07:42,105
<i>Where are you?</i>

51
00:07:42,185 --> 00:07:44,265
We are going to the next place now.

52
00:07:44,345 --> 00:07:45,345
We want to keep drinking at your home.

53
00:07:45,425 --> 00:07:46,705
Luan Nian, we are going to your home.

54
00:07:46,785 --> 00:07:48,705
We are going to keep celebrating!

55
00:07:48,785 --> 00:07:50,025
Don't come.

56
00:07:50,105 --> 00:07:51,145
Go back to your own homes.

57
00:07:51,225 --> 00:07:52,465
I don't welcome anyone.

58
00:08:10,865 --> 00:08:11,705
SUN YUANZHU

59
00:08:26,705 --> 00:08:27,665
She's still not answering?

60
00:09:25,865 --> 00:09:26,905
Luan Nian?

61
00:09:30,345 --> 00:09:31,305
Luke.

62
00:09:32,145 --> 00:09:33,265
Where am I?

63
00:09:34,345 --> 00:09:35,345
This is my house.

64
00:09:46,785 --> 00:09:47,625
Thank you.

65
00:09:49,625 --> 00:09:52,465
You were drunk
and couldn't say your address clearly.

66
00:09:53,185 --> 00:09:54,865
I had to bring you here

67
00:09:54,945 --> 00:09:57,385
and wait for you to sober up
before sending you home.

68
00:10:06,545 --> 00:10:09,465
Sorry for troubling you.

69
00:10:10,025 --> 00:10:11,425
Did I embarrass myself

70
00:10:12,665 --> 00:10:14,105
when I was drunk?

71
00:10:15,865 --> 00:10:16,705
You did.

72
00:10:27,505 --> 00:10:30,665
You spouted nonsense and confessed to me.

73
00:10:32,345 --> 00:10:34,105
You wanted me to marry you.

74
00:10:34,985 --> 00:10:37,345
Don't… Don't believe anything I said.

75
00:10:37,425 --> 00:10:41,945
They say the words you say
when you're drunk are all nonsense.

76
00:10:42,545 --> 00:10:45,025
When I am sober,
I've never thought about this.

77
00:10:51,945 --> 00:10:53,105
Are you single?

78
00:10:57,305 --> 00:10:58,345
Yes.

79
00:11:00,225 --> 00:11:01,345
Why don't we give it a try?

80
00:11:05,665 --> 00:11:06,865
No…

81
00:11:06,945 --> 00:11:08,105
There's no need.

82
00:11:09,065 --> 00:11:10,305
When it comes to thoughts

83
00:11:11,865 --> 00:11:14,385
that I shouldn't be having,
I can control them really well.

84
00:11:28,705 --> 00:11:31,225
Can you control the feeling of love?

85
00:11:42,225 --> 00:11:43,745
I'm going to the toilet.

86
00:12:15,585 --> 00:12:16,825
Are you going to my room?

87
00:12:21,185 --> 00:12:22,225
The toilet is on the right.

88
00:13:48,745 --> 00:13:50,105
Get changed.

89
00:13:50,185 --> 00:13:51,265
You'll feel more comfortable.

90
00:13:52,385 --> 00:13:53,545
Thank you.

91
00:14:08,105 --> 00:14:11,545
LONG ZHENTIAN

92
00:14:11,625 --> 00:14:13,545
Zhentian. Are you guys still outside?

93
00:14:13,625 --> 00:14:15,065
<i>I went home.</i>

94
00:14:15,145 --> 00:14:20,225
<i>Shang Zhitao met someone called Luke</i>
<i>at the bar a few hours ago.</i>

95
00:14:20,305 --> 00:14:21,865
<i>He asked her to work overtime.</i>

96
00:14:21,945 --> 00:14:23,105
Work overtime?

97
00:14:23,185 --> 00:14:27,745
<i>Yes. It was very unreasonable,</i>
<i>but Flora agreed.</i>

98
00:14:28,505 --> 00:14:30,825
All right. Rest early.

99
00:14:48,425 --> 00:14:50,465
<i>We're in the same boat.</i>

100
00:14:50,985 --> 00:14:52,185
<i>Let me dress the wound for you.</i>

101
00:14:52,865 --> 00:14:54,865
<i>I've been dreaming about you lately.</i>

102
00:14:54,945 --> 00:14:57,785
<i>In ancient times, you'd have to…</i>

103
00:14:59,025 --> 00:15:00,785
Marry me.

104
00:16:50,265 --> 00:16:51,305
<i>Have you finally realized?</i>

105
00:16:52,505 --> 00:16:54,105
<i>You can't control the feeling of love.</i>

106
00:17:07,625 --> 00:17:09,224
Your phone has been ringing all night.

107
00:17:10,145 --> 00:17:11,184
Answer it.

108
00:17:16,065 --> 00:17:17,224
-Hi, Sun Yu.
-<i>Tao.</i>

109
00:17:17,865 --> 00:17:18,944
You scared me.

110
00:17:19,025 --> 00:17:21,184
Sun Yuanzhu and I
almost called the police.

111
00:17:21,265 --> 00:17:22,825
<i>Where are you? We'll go pick you up.</i>

112
00:17:23,625 --> 00:17:24,704
No need.

113
00:17:25,305 --> 00:17:26,545
I can go back on my own.

114
00:17:27,385 --> 00:17:28,545
I'll take you home later.

115
00:17:30,105 --> 00:17:32,265
Why do I hear a man's voice?

116
00:17:32,985 --> 00:17:34,545
<i>Tao, are you safe?</i>

117
00:17:34,625 --> 00:17:35,705
<i>You must be safe.</i>

118
00:17:36,225 --> 00:17:37,185
<i>If you are in danger,</i>

119
00:17:37,265 --> 00:17:38,185
-I'm safe.
-<i>tap the phone.</i>

120
00:17:39,385 --> 00:17:40,985
I'm very safe.

121
00:17:41,065 --> 00:17:43,745
<i>Long Zhentian said a man called Luke</i>

122
00:17:43,825 --> 00:17:47,505
<i>took you away when you were at the bar.</i>

123
00:17:47,585 --> 00:17:50,105
Is Luke Luan Nian?

124
00:17:56,385 --> 00:17:57,345
It's him.

125
00:17:57,425 --> 00:17:58,345
<i>Got it.</i>

126
00:17:58,425 --> 00:18:00,345
<i>The rain is heavy outside.</i>
<i>It'll be hard to get a taxi.</i>

127
00:18:00,425 --> 00:18:03,145
<i>If you're coming back tomorrow,</i>
<i>remember to stay safe</i>

128
00:18:03,225 --> 00:18:04,225
<i>and protect yourself.</i>

129
00:18:04,305 --> 00:18:05,505
<i>All right. I'm hanging up.</i>

130
00:18:16,185 --> 00:18:17,025
Are you going back?

131
00:18:19,945 --> 00:18:21,585
It's raining outside.
You can't get a taxi easily.

132
00:18:22,225 --> 00:18:23,465
I drank, so I can't drive.

133
00:18:24,585 --> 00:18:25,585
Besides, your friend said

134
00:18:26,545 --> 00:18:27,905
it'd be troublesome
to get a taxi when it was raining.

135
00:18:27,985 --> 00:18:29,585
You can go back tomorrow.

136
00:18:36,865 --> 00:18:37,785
Sure.

137
00:18:42,225 --> 00:18:43,225
Shang Zhitao,

138
00:18:45,905 --> 00:18:47,465
are you sober now?

139
00:18:50,625 --> 00:18:52,425
Do you know what will happen next?

140
00:22:27,425 --> 00:22:28,505
<i>Thanks for last night.</i>

141
00:22:44,065 --> 00:22:45,505
<i>Welcome to the weather forecast.</i>

142
00:22:45,585 --> 00:22:48,305
<i>Today is April 12th, 2013.</i>

143
00:22:48,385 --> 00:22:50,145
<i>Beijing is cloudy, but turning clear.</i>

144
00:22:50,225 --> 00:22:52,825
<i>The temperature is around</i>
<i>23 degrees Celsius.</i>

145
00:22:52,905 --> 00:22:55,905
<i>Last night's storm brought</i>
<i>a good amount of nutrients to plants.</i>

146
00:22:55,985 --> 00:22:58,505
<i>There's sufficient sunlight today</i>
<i>with average humidity levels.</i>

147
00:23:32,145 --> 00:23:34,065
LUAN NIAN: IT'S NOTHING MUCH

148
00:23:39,465 --> 00:23:40,505
Hello.

149
00:23:51,345 --> 00:23:52,585
Is she from 2501?

150
00:23:53,425 --> 00:23:54,625
It's none of your business.

151
00:23:55,305 --> 00:23:56,145
Get back in your position.

152
00:24:16,785 --> 00:24:18,505
Today's weather sure is nice.

153
00:24:18,585 --> 00:24:20,145
The sun is shining brightly.

154
00:24:27,865 --> 00:24:28,825
Yes.

155
00:24:30,305 --> 00:24:31,625
How can the morning sun

156
00:24:33,505 --> 00:24:35,065
be so pretty?

157
00:25:40,145 --> 00:25:40,985
Great.

158
00:25:41,585 --> 00:25:42,785
You're giving me the silent treatment.

159
00:25:47,985 --> 00:25:49,585
You're a jerk.

160
00:25:49,665 --> 00:25:51,265
Why did you leave in a rush yesterday?

161
00:25:51,345 --> 00:25:54,065
You didn't even take your jacket
or drive your car.

162
00:25:54,585 --> 00:25:56,265
I had to deliver them to you.

163
00:26:23,145 --> 00:26:24,065
You're back.

164
00:26:31,585 --> 00:26:33,545
You're quite open-minded, Shang Zhitao.

165
00:26:33,625 --> 00:26:34,905
It was an accident.

166
00:26:35,505 --> 00:26:37,105
I know it was an accident for you.

167
00:26:37,625 --> 00:26:39,145
What about Luan Nian?

168
00:26:39,225 --> 00:26:40,465
Was it the same for him?

169
00:26:41,025 --> 00:26:42,265
I guess it counts as an accident.

170
00:26:43,985 --> 00:26:45,305
That's great.

171
00:26:46,185 --> 00:26:48,945
Men and women in this city
have happy accidents every day.

172
00:26:49,025 --> 00:26:49,945
It's a good thing.

173
00:26:50,025 --> 00:26:51,985
My hunch is always accurate.

174
00:26:52,065 --> 00:26:55,425
When you first
brought that girl to my place,

175
00:26:55,505 --> 00:26:58,745
I knew there would be a spark
between you two.

176
00:26:58,825 --> 00:27:00,745
You must have been planning this
for a long time.

177
00:27:00,825 --> 00:27:04,945
He first saved your life
and then created an accident.

178
00:27:05,025 --> 00:27:05,905
In my opinion,

179
00:27:05,985 --> 00:27:09,625
he has been advancing step by step
for a long time.

180
00:27:11,145 --> 00:27:13,585
Don't make it sound like he's a jerk.

181
00:27:13,665 --> 00:27:15,425
I still respect him a lot.

182
00:27:15,505 --> 00:27:17,065
Respect? What kind of respect?

183
00:27:17,145 --> 00:27:18,785
Bowing to him on the bed?

184
00:27:18,865 --> 00:27:19,705
Enough…

185
00:27:21,305 --> 00:27:23,465
I have no interest in spending time
and energy to date someone.

186
00:27:24,065 --> 00:27:25,705
You don't date people, indeed.

187
00:27:25,785 --> 00:27:27,225
Girls are the ones
throwing themselves at you.

188
00:27:31,625 --> 00:27:33,785
She's really not the type
to throw herself at someone.

189
00:27:40,425 --> 00:27:42,265
Then you've got to tell me about that.

190
00:27:44,985 --> 00:27:47,945
So, what kind of person is she?

191
00:27:49,505 --> 00:27:51,265
<i>Even among us,</i>
<i>people can be very different.</i>

192
00:27:51,345 --> 00:27:54,945
The ideas he comes up with in 0.1 seconds
can satisfy the clients.

193
00:27:55,905 --> 00:27:57,025
He is talented

194
00:27:57,105 --> 00:28:00,865
and has become an expert in this industry
at such a young age.

195
00:28:00,945 --> 00:28:04,145
Any ordinary person
will need ten years, at least,

196
00:28:04,225 --> 00:28:06,025
to reach his position.

197
00:28:06,105 --> 00:28:07,865
I get it now.

198
00:28:07,945 --> 00:28:10,665
Men who are outstanding at work
are indeed charming.

199
00:28:13,065 --> 00:28:14,865
What about his life?
How is his private life?

200
00:28:23,945 --> 00:28:26,785
I think he's a bit lonely.

201
00:28:29,345 --> 00:28:31,945
Shang Zhitao, you're done for.

202
00:28:32,985 --> 00:28:34,865
When you unknowingly feel sorry for a man,

203
00:28:34,945 --> 00:28:38,185
it's the beginning
of falling wholeheartedly in love.

204
00:28:38,705 --> 00:28:43,265
I really think Ms. Shang
is different from all those girls

205
00:28:43,345 --> 00:28:46,785
who fawned over you
and flattered you in the past.

206
00:28:46,865 --> 00:28:49,185
She seems kind and pure.

207
00:28:49,265 --> 00:28:50,785
If you two are meant for each other,

208
00:28:50,865 --> 00:28:52,945
don't stick to your outdated beliefs.

209
00:28:53,025 --> 00:28:55,945
Let go of your past prejudices
and try dating her.

210
00:28:56,025 --> 00:28:57,865
That's your prejudice against me.

211
00:28:59,105 --> 00:29:00,945
In your opinion, am I evil or am I a jerk?

212
00:29:02,065 --> 00:29:04,105
I wish you were a jerk.

213
00:29:04,625 --> 00:29:06,825
You need to know your true self.

214
00:29:06,905 --> 00:29:08,825
You are just an arrogant, silly,
and oblivious guy.

215
00:29:10,145 --> 00:29:12,065
Once a girl starts clinging to you,

216
00:29:12,145 --> 00:29:14,065
you immediately turn into
a heartless man who needs no love.

217
00:29:16,225 --> 00:29:17,905
Listen to me.

218
00:29:17,985 --> 00:29:20,585
Love at first sight
or love that never fades

219
00:29:20,665 --> 00:29:21,985
doesn't exist in this world.

220
00:29:22,545 --> 00:29:23,385
Wake up.

221
00:29:23,465 --> 00:29:24,905
Get lost.

222
00:29:26,265 --> 00:29:28,145
Fine. I still have something to do
at my restaurant.

223
00:29:28,225 --> 00:29:29,385
I won't disturb you anymore.

224
00:29:30,505 --> 00:29:31,465
I'm leaving.

225
00:29:35,705 --> 00:29:38,025
Whose… Whose bag is this?

226
00:29:40,145 --> 00:29:41,065
Just leave it there.

227
00:29:44,305 --> 00:29:46,145
Ms. Shang purposely left it here.

228
00:29:46,225 --> 00:29:47,745
She's playing hard to get.

229
00:29:48,345 --> 00:29:49,705
Take your chance when you need to.

230
00:29:50,705 --> 00:29:51,585
Go for it.

231
00:29:52,225 --> 00:29:53,065
I'm leaving.

232
00:30:08,425 --> 00:30:09,305
LUAN NIAN

233
00:30:13,425 --> 00:30:15,025
Answer it. Answer it.

234
00:30:18,945 --> 00:30:19,825
<i>It's Luke.</i>

235
00:30:19,905 --> 00:30:20,745
<i>Where are you?</i>

236
00:30:22,065 --> 00:30:22,945
I'm home.

237
00:30:24,745 --> 00:30:25,945
<i>I'll come find you tonight.</i>

238
00:30:26,705 --> 00:30:27,785
Sure.

239
00:30:30,345 --> 00:30:31,865
What did he say?

240
00:30:32,465 --> 00:30:33,865
He said

241
00:30:35,185 --> 00:30:36,585
he'd come find me tonight.

242
00:30:39,465 --> 00:30:40,825
He's going to confess.

243
00:30:42,505 --> 00:30:44,625
I don't think so.

244
00:30:44,705 --> 00:30:47,905
Regardless, you must
put on full makeup tonight.

245
00:30:47,985 --> 00:30:50,185
Even if you're just taking a stroll,
you must look pretty.

246
00:30:50,265 --> 00:30:51,665
Go. Get changed.

247
00:30:51,745 --> 00:30:52,785
Hurry up.

248
00:30:53,425 --> 00:30:54,705
Stop wasting time.

249
00:31:50,025 --> 00:31:51,345
You've put on makeup.

250
00:31:57,945 --> 00:31:59,785
Why did you ask to meet up?

251
00:32:03,305 --> 00:32:04,425
Are you sober now?

252
00:32:12,065 --> 00:32:13,345
You left your bag at my place.

253
00:32:15,785 --> 00:32:16,865
I forgot.

254
00:32:17,585 --> 00:32:18,825
Thanks.

255
00:32:22,345 --> 00:32:23,505
Sorry.

256
00:32:23,585 --> 00:32:26,225
I made you come all the way here
to return my bag.

257
00:32:26,865 --> 00:32:28,585
Ms. Shang purposely left it here.

258
00:32:28,665 --> 00:32:29,625
She's playing hard to get.

259
00:32:31,545 --> 00:32:33,145
You purposely left your bag at my place

260
00:32:33,225 --> 00:32:34,705
so I'd come and find you.

261
00:32:39,905 --> 00:32:40,865
It wasn't on purpose.

262
00:32:44,905 --> 00:32:46,465
Are you worried that I'd cling to you?

263
00:32:57,585 --> 00:32:58,745
Don't worry.

264
00:32:59,585 --> 00:33:02,905
Last night was just an accident
between two adults.

265
00:33:03,705 --> 00:33:05,785
Thank you again for coming here
to return my bag.

266
00:33:06,545 --> 00:33:07,585
I'm going back.

267
00:33:59,425 --> 00:34:02,785
<i>You purposely left your bag at my place</i>
<i>so I'd come and find you.</i>

268
00:34:21,025 --> 00:34:23,105
Why… Why are you back so soon?

269
00:34:27,865 --> 00:34:29,304
What happened?

270
00:34:37,304 --> 00:34:38,865
I left my bag at his place.

271
00:34:38,945 --> 00:34:40,344
He came to return it.

272
00:34:42,905 --> 00:34:44,744
And he told me

273
00:34:46,185 --> 00:34:47,985
not to get the wrong idea.

274
00:34:51,185 --> 00:34:52,344
What a jerk.

275
00:34:52,425 --> 00:34:53,385
I…

276
00:35:02,265 --> 00:35:03,585
What's done is done.

277
00:35:03,665 --> 00:35:05,145
Stop thinking about it.

278
00:35:05,665 --> 00:35:07,985
People make rash decisions all the time.

279
00:35:08,545 --> 00:35:11,305
He takes advantage of his good looks,
so he sees women as his prey.

280
00:35:11,385 --> 00:35:13,385
Just stay away from him in the future.

281
00:35:15,745 --> 00:35:16,585
Look at me.

282
00:35:16,665 --> 00:35:19,945
Do you know
the three golden rules of modern love?

283
00:35:23,545 --> 00:35:24,945
Don't ask about the past.

284
00:35:25,625 --> 00:35:26,785
Don't gamble on the future.

285
00:35:26,865 --> 00:35:28,905
Cherish the present.

286
00:35:31,585 --> 00:35:33,745
I overestimated myself.

287
00:35:34,385 --> 00:35:38,105
He and I are not from the same world.

288
00:35:41,145 --> 00:35:42,705
I still fell for it.

289
00:35:43,745 --> 00:35:48,225
I didn't want to hear it from him,
so I said it was an accident yesterday.

290
00:35:52,745 --> 00:35:54,225
When it comes to love,

291
00:35:54,905 --> 00:35:57,105
no one is right or wrong.

292
00:35:57,705 --> 00:35:59,385
You think he's experienced,

293
00:35:59,905 --> 00:36:02,985
but he might have gotten hurt once
by a woman as well.

294
00:36:03,905 --> 00:36:05,025
Probably.

295
00:36:07,185 --> 00:36:10,105
I'm just a passerby in his love life.

296
00:36:10,185 --> 00:36:12,145
Tao, cheer up.

297
00:36:12,225 --> 00:36:14,185
Love isn't the only thing in life.

298
00:36:25,785 --> 00:36:27,785
I'll attend English lessons
starting tomorrow.

299
00:36:27,865 --> 00:36:29,545
I'm going to study and improve.

300
00:36:29,625 --> 00:36:30,745
That's right.

301
00:36:30,825 --> 00:36:32,585
Improve and study whenever you can.

302
00:36:32,665 --> 00:36:34,065
Focus on yourself.

303
00:36:34,145 --> 00:36:36,345
Don't let love sidetrack your ambition.

304
00:36:36,425 --> 00:36:38,345
I'm counting on you
to support me in the future.

305
00:36:38,905 --> 00:36:40,865
That's right. I want bread
for tomorrow morning.

306
00:36:40,945 --> 00:36:41,865
Bring some back after class.

307
00:36:42,465 --> 00:36:45,225
To repay you, I can introduce you
to some of our finest clients.

308
00:36:45,305 --> 00:36:47,385
Pick anyone you want.

309
00:36:47,465 --> 00:36:48,665
I don't need you to repay the favor.

310
00:36:48,745 --> 00:36:50,265
Of course I'll bring you bread.

311
00:36:51,865 --> 00:36:52,985
Sure.

312
00:36:59,665 --> 00:37:00,945
Bread is indeed…

313
00:37:04,345 --> 00:37:05,825
more important than love.

314
00:37:11,145 --> 00:37:12,785
<i>You really are a silly and oblivious guy.</i>

315
00:37:13,305 --> 00:37:15,105
<i>I was just saying,</i>
<i>and you actually went and asked her.</i>

316
00:37:15,825 --> 00:37:16,985
<i>Hurry and go make it up to her.</i>

317
00:37:24,825 --> 00:37:27,585
<i>This bag I just sent you</i>
<i>is a limited-edition design.</i>

318
00:37:27,665 --> 00:37:29,865
<i>However, it's already</i>
<i>reserved for a customer.</i>

319
00:37:29,945 --> 00:37:30,985
<i>If you like it, I'll order it for you.</i>

320
00:37:31,065 --> 00:37:32,145
I want this one.

321
00:37:32,225 --> 00:37:33,185
I want it today.

322
00:37:33,265 --> 00:37:35,105
<i>Mr. Luan, this won't do.</i>

323
00:37:35,625 --> 00:37:36,905
<i>This one is for another customer.</i>

324
00:37:36,985 --> 00:37:39,185
<i>For this one, we need to allocate stock</i>
<i>before we can get it from another store.</i>

325
00:37:39,265 --> 00:37:40,745
Do what you must.

326
00:37:40,825 --> 00:37:42,705
If I can get it by today,

327
00:37:42,785 --> 00:37:46,105
I'll buy out your shop's watches,
belts, and cutlery.

328
00:37:46,825 --> 00:37:47,665
I'll come pick them up later.

329
00:37:48,465 --> 00:37:50,265
<i>Sure. I'll think of something.</i>

330
00:37:50,345 --> 00:37:52,945
<i>I'll get everything ready for you</i>
<i>and have someone deliver them to your car.</i>

331
00:38:09,585 --> 00:38:12,145
THE NEXT TRAIN ARRIVES IN ONE MINUTE

332
00:38:19,505 --> 00:38:21,345
It means you gain wisdom
through experience.

333
00:38:48,225 --> 00:38:50,185
SUN YU: DON'T FORGET TO BUY BREAD

334
00:38:51,345 --> 00:38:53,865
Mr. Long, let's end the lesson here.

335
00:38:53,945 --> 00:38:54,785
I still have something to do.

336
00:38:56,385 --> 00:38:57,905
-Let me pay the bill.
-No.

337
00:38:57,985 --> 00:39:00,065
It's my treat today.
You taught me English today.

338
00:39:01,185 --> 00:39:02,865
Let me pay today.

339
00:39:02,945 --> 00:39:07,465
In the next lesson, you can tell me
more about Chinese allusions

340
00:39:07,545 --> 00:39:08,705
to pay me back.

341
00:39:08,785 --> 00:39:11,345
Sure. In the next lesson, I'll tell you

342
00:39:11,425 --> 00:39:13,385
a story about reciprocity
and returning kindness.

343
00:39:13,985 --> 00:39:15,385
I only know the phrase,

344
00:39:15,905 --> 00:39:18,985
"Don't bite the hand that feeds you."

345
00:39:19,065 --> 00:39:21,145
You know quite a lot.

346
00:39:21,225 --> 00:39:22,065
It's nothing much.

347
00:39:25,265 --> 00:39:27,465
HAPPINESS PASTRY

348
00:39:29,305 --> 00:39:30,585
BLACK TRUFFLE MUSHROOM BEEF PUFF
30.6 YUAN

349
00:39:30,665 --> 00:39:31,465
CHEESY CHICKEN BUN, 30.6 YUAN

350
00:39:31,545 --> 00:39:32,705
BIRTHDAY PARTY HAT

351
00:39:33,465 --> 00:39:34,945
Why are they so expensive?

352
00:39:38,905 --> 00:39:41,025
HALF PRICE AT 9 P.M. EVERY NIGHT

353
00:39:45,025 --> 00:39:46,385
SUN YU

354
00:39:51,025 --> 00:39:52,145
Sun Yu.

355
00:39:52,225 --> 00:39:54,985
The bread here is half price after nine.

356
00:39:55,065 --> 00:39:56,865
What do you want? I'll buy them for you.

357
00:39:59,665 --> 00:40:00,945
Sure.

358
00:40:04,425 --> 00:40:06,305
LUAN NIAN: ARE YOU STILL AT HOME?

359
00:40:20,385 --> 00:40:23,385
<i>They say the heart is a narrow door.</i>

360
00:40:23,465 --> 00:40:26,745
<i>Once you get hurt,</i>
<i>it'll leave a crack that gets in the way.</i>

361
00:40:28,385 --> 00:40:30,385
<i>When your sincerity</i>
<i>is being taken lightly,</i>

362
00:40:30,465 --> 00:40:32,385
<i>it's worse than getting hurt physically.</i>

363
00:40:32,905 --> 00:40:35,465
<i>The soft thorn deep in my heart,</i>

364
00:40:35,545 --> 00:40:37,025
<i>once touched, brings embarrassment.</i>

365
00:40:37,545 --> 00:40:39,665
<i>Just thinking about it</i>
<i>makes me feel disheartened.</i>

366
00:40:45,865 --> 00:40:46,905
Dear customers,

367
00:40:46,985 --> 00:40:49,905
our freshly baked bread
will be sold at half price soon.

368
00:40:49,985 --> 00:40:52,625
If you are interested,
please proceed to the bread area.

369
00:40:52,705 --> 00:40:53,585
HAPPINESS PASTRY

370
00:41:09,625 --> 00:41:10,505
Luke?

371
00:41:10,585 --> 00:41:11,745
Why are you here?

372
00:41:11,825 --> 00:41:13,385
Can I help you?

373
00:41:30,825 --> 00:41:31,665
It's for you.

374
00:41:43,025 --> 00:41:44,585
I don't need this.

375
00:41:46,385 --> 00:41:47,945
That bag of yours is too old.

376
00:41:48,025 --> 00:41:48,905
Use a new one.

377
00:41:50,865 --> 00:41:53,105
This bag is good enough.

378
00:41:53,185 --> 00:41:54,345
I don't need to change it.

379
00:41:55,185 --> 00:41:56,585
Don't worry.

380
00:41:57,705 --> 00:42:00,065
What happened two days ago
was an accident.

381
00:42:01,265 --> 00:42:02,265
You're afraid of being pestered.

382
00:42:03,065 --> 00:42:04,385
And I'm also quite busy.

383
00:42:07,425 --> 00:42:08,785
Is that what you think?

384
00:42:13,465 --> 00:42:15,465
There's nothing more to it.

385
00:42:16,185 --> 00:42:17,345
Don't worry.

386
00:42:17,425 --> 00:42:19,185
I'm a pragmatist.

387
00:42:19,265 --> 00:42:21,505
Between work and love,
I'll surely choose work.

388
00:42:23,665 --> 00:42:24,585
In the future,

389
00:42:25,825 --> 00:42:26,985
let's just…

390
00:42:30,625 --> 00:42:32,345
forget this ever happened.

391
00:42:32,425 --> 00:42:33,785
Let's just be strangers.

392
00:42:35,865 --> 00:42:36,985
You care a lot about this job.

393
00:42:39,065 --> 00:42:39,905
Of course.

394
00:42:40,945 --> 00:42:44,705
I hope this incident
won't affect your opinion of my work.

395
00:42:45,825 --> 00:42:46,745
It won't.

396
00:42:51,545 --> 00:42:52,465
That's good to hear.

397
00:42:56,585 --> 00:42:57,625
You may go back.

398
00:42:58,345 --> 00:43:00,905
This bag is too expensive.
It's not suitable for me.

399
00:43:04,385 --> 00:43:07,865
So even without accepting the bag,
you still want to date me?

400
00:43:28,505 --> 00:43:29,905
We are…

401
00:43:32,865 --> 00:43:35,385
not in an official relationship.

402
00:43:36,945 --> 00:43:37,785
Tao…

403
00:43:39,105 --> 00:43:43,305
What is an official relationship
in this day and age?

404
00:43:43,385 --> 00:43:46,705
A sincere promise or a fake confession?

405
00:43:46,785 --> 00:43:49,385
Love is always complicated.

406
00:43:49,465 --> 00:43:51,705
Even if it's planned,
it's not necessarily fake.

407
00:43:51,785 --> 00:43:54,625
Even if you're discussing marriage,
it might still not be true love.

408
00:43:56,105 --> 00:43:58,145
He is my boss.

409
00:43:59,105 --> 00:44:02,385
When I joined the company,
he asked me to quit on my first day.

410
00:44:02,465 --> 00:44:04,185
I was very nervous back then.

411
00:44:07,985 --> 00:44:10,945
I felt that he wasn't joking
when he said that.

412
00:44:11,025 --> 00:44:11,985
Did you offend him?

413
00:44:13,905 --> 00:44:15,305
Then I'm sure he is interested in you.

414
00:44:15,865 --> 00:44:17,505
I don't think so.

415
00:44:18,225 --> 00:44:20,345
He doesn't seem like someone
who lacks girlfriends.

416
00:44:22,385 --> 00:44:25,345
In his eyes, I'm probably

417
00:44:27,145 --> 00:44:29,545
a person made up entirely of flaws.

418
00:44:30,625 --> 00:44:34,185
I should probably focus
on how to survive in Lime.

